# TrueVision version-locked three.js / BVH / projection runtime (must be deployed to live)
# The `build/` rule above hits THREE directories inside this vendor tree:
#   01__Vendor__ThreeJs__v0.184.0/build/           - three.module.js and three.core.js
#   02__Vendor__ThreeMeshBvh__v0.9.9/build/        - the packaged UMD/ESM bundles
#   02__Vendor__ThreeMeshBvh__v0.9.9/src/core/build/ - 8 SOURCE files imported at module load
# Without these negations the push succeeds, nothing looks wrong locally, and the live
# site 404s on the import map. Verify with `git check-ignore -v <a build/ file>`.
!na-apps/30__TrueVision__CoreAppCode/04__Lib__ThirdParty__VersionLocked/**/build/
!na-apps/30__TrueVision__CoreAppCode/04__Lib__ThirdParty__VersionLocked/**/build/**

